MLX90640.cpp, MLX90640.hpp
  The EEPROM calibration extraction (Extract*Parameters, ExtractDeviatingPixels,
  CheckAdjacentPixels), the temperature and image calculation, and the frame /
  auxiliary-data validation and bad-pixel correction routines are a C++
  adaptation of the Melexis MLX90640 driver library.
  Upstream: https://github.com/melexis/mlx90640-library, functions/MLX90640_API.c
            (compared with revision f6be7ca1d4a55146b705f3d347f84b773b29cc86).
